#. type: Content of: <div><h1>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:5
msgid "Read the Linux From Scratch Book Online"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:7
msgid "Current Stable"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:9
msgid ""
"This is the latest released LFS systemd book, considered stable.  "
"Most people will want to read this book."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:12
msgid ""
"As a result of bugs and security warnings, please be sure to read "
"both the errata page and the Security Advisories for any "
"modifications needed to the LFS build."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:16
msgid "<a href=\"errata/stable-systemd/\">Stable LFS systemd Errata</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:17 xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:50
msgid "<a href=\"../advisories/\">LFS Security Advisories</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:18
msgid "<a href=\"view/stable-systemd/\">Stable LFS systemd</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:32
msgid "Current Development"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:33
msgid ""
"This is the LFS systemd Book in its current development state.  While "
"it may provide more features and updated upstream packages than the "
"stable book, it is more prone to bugs and security vulnerabilities. "
"Use with care."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:38
msgid "<a href=\"view/systemd/\">Development LFS systemd</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:42
msgid "Prior versions of LFS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:44
msgid "The prior System V version of LFS is no longer maintained."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:46
msgid ""
"You can read the most recent stable book and Security Advisories at "
"the URLs below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:51
msgid "<a href=\"view/stable/\">Stable LFS</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:53
msgid ""
"For existing LFS 12.4 users, security advisories are maintained and "
"the security advisories present for LFS 13.0 have been tested. "
"However, some advisories may not be applicable depending on whether a "
"package is present in LFS 12.4."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:72
msgid "Current Status"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:74
msgid ""
"This is the System V LFS Book in its current form. The build "
"instructions for packages are relatively unchanged when new packages "
"are released and most of the instructions are common with the systemd "
"book above.  However the package instructions have not been validated "
"for the System V environment."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:80
msgid "<a href=\"view/development/\">LFS System V Snapshot</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:82
msgid "Translations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:84
msgid ""
"The LFS book has been translated in various languages.  Note that "
"these translations were done by volunteers and may contain "
"translation errors which the LFS team cannot control.  In that case, "
"contact the translator directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:89
msgid ""
"<em>Please note that all versions of LFS &lt;= 5.1 contain "
"instructions that create an English-only system and therefore will "
"require additional undocumented work (i.e. setting LANG and font)  in "
"order for the system to be useful in another language.</em>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/read.html:94
msgid ""
"If you have translated the LFS book or if you are aware of "
"translations not in this list, please send us an e-mail to the site "
"<a href=\"mailto:webmaster@linuxfromscratch.org\">webmaster</a> with "
"the URL to the translation."
msgstr ""

